WEBVTT

00:00:01.545 --> 00:00:05.310
Pick the agent whose variables the list fills

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:08.295
Upload your CSV under Upload calling list

00:00:08.295 --> 00:00:09.497
The preview shows your file, 15 rows per page

00:00:09.497 --> 00:00:10.900
Matching headers are mapped automatically

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.621
Map the rest by hand: amount_due → due_amount

00:00:14.621 --> 00:00:16.867
One country code for the whole list (+91 default)

00:00:16.867 --> 00:00:19.119
Remove invalid rows is on by default

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:21.620
Transliterate names into the agent's language

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:25.814
Click Next: Ringg verifies every row

00:00:25.814 --> 00:00:29.553
Invalid rows are counted and can be downloaded
